            "title": "Refine your Focus with Mantra",
            "title_tag": "h4",
            "title_font_style": "h5",
            "description": "<p>We are always meditating on something – but it’s often our problems and worries. <strong>Mantra meditation helps us to take back control of the mind and focus it onsomething positive.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "content_block_bRpdR3": {
