            "title": "Enter the Heart with Guided Meditation",
            "title_tag": "h3",
            "title_font_style": "h5",
            "description": "<p>Go deeper with <strong>guided meditations to calm the mind and enter the spaciousness of the heart</strong>, opening your life and relationships up to experience more connectionand fulfillment.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_block_FzqmmK": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/icon-placeholder.png",
            "title": "Make the Mind your Friend",
            "title_tag": "h3",
            "title_font_style": "h5",
            "description": "<p>This course isn’t about sitting perfectly still or stopping your thoughts; instead you will learn<strong>how to make the mind your friend, so it works for you, notagainst you.</strong></p>"
          }
        }
      },
