    "section_review_carousel_dNJAUb": {
      "type": "section__review-carousel",
      "blocks": {
        "content_block_eQzmnx": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_0334.jpg",
            "content": "<p><em>“Swami Tulsidas has such a loving presence in the way that he guides others in their path of meditation. There is this special heart element that takes listeners out of their minds and, even if just for a moment, so often brings them to what I believe is the essence of Yoga itself: this deeper connection with the Divine. If you have not had the chance to dive deeper in this way, I would highly recommend attending one of his meditation courses!”</em></p>",
            "credits": "Quinn, Orlando, FL"
          }
        },
        "content_block_6zgi88": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_0334.jpg",
            "content": "<p><em>“After learning to meditate, I noticed shifts in myself like being more emotionally balanced and able to handle the ups and downs of life. I look forward to my practice every day!”</em></p>",
            "credits": "Ally, Long Island, NY"
          }
        },
        "content_block_tzKzba": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_1603.jpg",
            "content": "<p><em><strong> \"I feel connected to this Divine essence in a way my previous practices weren’t capable of providing.\"</strong></em><em><br/><br/>“I started eagerly practicing yoga at age 15, teaching at 19, and essentially ‘fell out of love’ with the physical aspect of the practice. Later on, Atma Kriya gave a completely new life to my relationship with yoga. Through the various techniques provided, I feel connected to this Divine essence in a way my previous practices weren’t capable of providing. Atma Kriya was certainly the missing key.”</em> </p>",
            "credits": "—Moriah, Boulder, CO"
          }
        },
        "content_block_N7pUYF": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/photo_2025-03-25_23-05-13.jpg",
            "content": "<p><em><strong>\"Receiving this spiritual practice which was given by a living enlightened Master allowed me to trust it much more fully\"</strong></em><em><br/><br/>“Despite being earnest in my attempts to meditate prior to learning Atma Kriya Yoga, there was always some lingering doubt or concern that perhaps I wasn’t doing it properly, or perhaps a different technique would be better, etc. etc. But receiving this spiritual practice which was given by a living enlightened Master allowed me to trust it much more fully - which in turn allowed me to enjoy it more fully and go much deeper.</em>” </p>",
            "credits": "—Jeremiah, Eugene, OR"
          }
        },
        "content_block_qBj7b4": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/photo_2025-03-25_23-06-09.jpg",
            "content": "<p><em><strong>\"It has changed my life in so many different ways; the most important being acceptance of who I am.\"</strong></em><em><br/><br/>Atma Kriya Yoga is something I look forward to doing everyday. It's a time when nothing else matters, it's just time for quieting my mind, being with the Divine and opening my heart. This time is like no other. I can sit and find peace, forgiveness & love. It has changed my life in so many different ways; the most important being acceptance of who I am. I will forever love this practice and all that it brings to not only me but everyone around me.”</em> </p>",
            "credits": "—Samantha, Elmira, NY"
          }
        },
        "content_block_Dw8dUV": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/photo_2025-03-21_16-57-13.jpg",
            "content": "<p><em><strong>\"Atma Kriya Yoga came into my life when I was least expecting it...\"</strong></em><em><br/><br/>Atma Kriya Yoga came into my life when I was least expecting it and it changed it in the best possible way. Personally, this has been such a wonderful journey of rediscovery of who I really am and what my purpose in this life is. To me it has become a lifestyle, my daily spiritual food that keeps me centered and strong through the ups and downs of life and that showers me with unconditional love no matter what. If you are considering taking Atma Kriya Yoga don’t let your mind stop you, just go for it! You will not regret it. </em></p>",
            "credits": "—Vesna, Rochester NY"
          }
        },
        "content_block_WkWfBL": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/photo_2025-03-25_23-21-07.jpg",
            "content": "<p><strong>\"The techniques have helped to ground me and make me more and more the version of a person I wish to be.\"</strong><br/><br/>Atma Kriya Yoga is a life changing meditation that will bring you closer to your Divine Self. There is so much there and whatever Divine desire you have can be fulfilled through the sincere practice of Atma Kriya. The techniques have helped to ground me and make me more and more the version of the person I wish to be. I recommend them to anyone and hope you decide to learn this timeless and most precious gift known as Atma Kriya.</p>",
            "credits": "Deva, New Orleans"
          }
        }
      },
