        "desktop_padding_top": "inherit",
        "desktop_padding_bottom": "tabletl:pb-xxxl",
        "title": "A Master for our time: Paramahamsa Vishwananda",
        "content": "<p>Paramahamsa Vishwananda is a fully realized enlightened master, direct disciple of Mahavatar Babaji, and world renowned Satguru. He is an incarnation of Divine Love, and is here to empower you to discover this never-ending Love for yourself. His expert guidance, unsurpassed wisdom, and loving presence is unparalleled. Don’t miss this rare opportunity to spend 4-days learning directly from the greatest spiritual teacher of our time!</p>",
        "marquee_speed": 28
      }
    },
    "section_event_calendar_fF9RNM": {
      "type": "section__event-calendar",
      "blocks": {
        "calendar_item_zrtK3J": {
          "type": "Calendar_item",
          "settings": {
            "date_title": "Day 1",
            "title": "Discovery",
            "content": "<p>Soul Awakening begins with the discovery of your true self, a journey inward to understand the nature of the soul. Through practices such as meditation and mindful action, you learn to detach from the distractions of the external world and recognize the eternal presence within. This step is about awakening to your spiritual essence and realizing that the soul's true nature is pure, unchanging, and intimately connected to the Divine.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/day01.jpg"
          }
        },
        "calendar_item_wCjn8G": {
          "type": "Calendar_item",
          "settings": {
            "date_title": "Day 2",
            "title": "Awakening",
            "content": "<p>In the second step, you experience a deeper level of awakening as you begin to align your actions with the awareness of your soul. The heart opens to a higher consciousness, and the bhakti (devotion) within you starts to flourish. You cultivate devotion through prayer, chanting, and surrender, all of which allow you to feel the presence of Divine Love in every moment. This phase is about experiencing divine connection and surrendering to the grace that flows through your being.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/day02.jpg"
          }
        },
        "calendar_item_ArQz9V": {
          "type": "Calendar_item",
          "settings": {
            "date_title": "Day 3",
            "title": "Mastery",
            "content": "<p>As your practice deepens, you enter the phase of mastery, where the awareness of the soul becomes a part of your daily life. You move beyond technique and reach a state of effortless devotion. Your actions, thoughts, and feelings are naturally aligned with the Divine, and you experience inner peace, compassion, and joy. At this stage, you have refined your practice and are living in harmony with the higher energies that guide you on your spiritual journey.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/2022-07-16-p-0413.jpg"
          }
        },
        "calendar_item_cfHkfC": {
          "type": "Calendar_item",
          "settings": {
            "date_title": "Day 4",
            "title": "Transformation",
            "content": "<p>The final step is the transmission of divine energy, or Shaktipat, directly from the source of all creation. In this transformative moment, Paramahamsa Vishwananda’s grace descends upon you, awakening your inner potential and elevating your spiritual practice to new heights. With Shaktipat, you experience the direct touch of the Divine, igniting a deeper connection to your true self and opening the door to the ultimate realization of God’s love within you.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Image_adbe1761-923f-493f-ba55-3da2dbabcab5.jpg"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "calendar_item_zrtK3J",
