    "section_accordion_eVtHNJ": {
      "type": "section__accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_item_emUQpJ": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who is this program for? Do I need to be religious to join the program?",
            "content": "<p>Soul awakening is for everyone, from those just starting on their spiritual journey to seasoned practitioners. <br/><br/>While the teachings are rooted in the Vedic Tradition, the wisdom given trancends religious boundary and can be applied to every person in all walks of life. <br/><br/>Atma Kriya Yoga is a spiritual, but non-religious practice which can help you deepen your connection to any form of the Divine which you feel closest to. </p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_rPjfcM": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the difference between the online and in-person Soul Awakening Program?",
            "content": "<p>The online Soul Awakening does not include access to the physical venue, meals, or in-person shaktipat initiation with Paramahamsa Vishwananda. <br/><br/>The in-person gives a more immersive experience, while the online version allows you to access and experience this once in a lifetime program from the comfort of your home. </p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_7TFdiQ": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if I have a physical limitation? Can I still learn Atma Kriya?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Your teacher on-site can show you proper modifications for many of the techniques. <br/><br/>If attending online, you will have the opportunity to speak with a teacher who can help with modifications to specific techniques as needed. <br/><br/>Depending on the nature of the physical limitation, you may want to check with a teacher before the course on how we can best support your individual needs. </p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_mQ3rJ9": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is there a payment plan available?",
            "content": "<p>Payment plan options are available at checkout. Options may vary depending on your country. <br/><br/>If you would like to apply for a scholorship to attend Soul Awakening please contact us at info@bhaktimarga.us </p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_7CKjgY": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I get shaktipat if I am online only?",
            "content": "<p>There are Atma Kriya Yoga Teachers around the world who give Shaktipat Initiation. We will happily connect you to a teacher near you so you can get shaktipat as soon as possible. </p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_mwprCe": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the AKY initiation (Shaktipat) the same as a devotee initiation? Do I need to take Paramahamsa Vishwananda as my Guru to learn Atma Kriya Yoga?",
            "content": "<p>No, the Shaktipat Initiation given at the end of the AKY course will initiate the student into Atma Kriya Yoga which is part of the Kriya Yoga Lineage only.<br/><br/>No, Paramahamsa Vishwananda does not need to be your Guru to take Atma Kriya Yoga. AKY is a universal practice. <br/><br/>However, please note, if you have a different Guru it is best to ask them if you should take AKY out of respect for your teacher and lineage. </p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_Bpxjbg": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will it be recorded?",
            "content": "<p>All lectures and talks with Paramahamsa Vishwananda for Soul Awakening will be recorded. <br/><br/>For confidentiality of the techniques, the section of teaching the physical techniques will not be recorded. You will receive a course manual to refer to with details on how to do all of the techniques to help as you learn. </p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_a6Qb7Q": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I join if I already have Atma Kriya Yoga? Do I get a discount?",
            "content": "<p>You are warmly welcomed to join Soul Awakening if you have already been initiated into Atma Kriya Yoga. <br/><br/>However, <em>only those who have not been initiated yet may receive initiation from Paramahamsa Vishwananda. </em><br/><br/>You are welcome to join the entire program, including a refresher of the techniques. <br/><br/>Please note that this is a unique course with Paramahamsa Vishwananda and no discounts are given for current initiated Atma Kriya Yogis. Thank you for understanding. </p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_PabXqd": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I get to Elmira, New York?",
            "content": "<p>Elmira, New York is located in the Southern Tier Region of Upstate, New York.  <br/><br/>Here are some helpful resources for getting to the Paranitya Narasimha Center: <br/><br/><strong>Find a Direct Flight </strong></p><p>The nearest airport to the ashram is the Elmira Corning Regional Airport. As flights direct to this airport can be expensive, we recommend looking for a flight first to an airport with a direct flight to Elmira, and then take a direct flight from these airports to Elmira. </p><p><strong>You can find direct flights from: </strong></p><p>Detroit (DTW)<br/>Orlando (SFB)<br/>Punta Gorda (PGD)<br/>Tampa (PIE) <br/><strong><br/>Nearest Airports </strong></p><ul><li>Elmira Corning Regional (ELM) – 15 minute drive </li><li>Ithaca Tompkins International(ITH) – 45 minute drive </li><li>Syracuse Hancock International (SYR) – 1 hr 45 min. drive </li><li>Greater Rochester International (ROC) – 2 hour drive </li><li>Newark Liberty International (EWR) – 3.5 hour drive <br/><br/>From NYC </li><li>Drive: 4.5 (depending on traffic) </li><li>Bus: There are affordable buses from NYC using OurBus. ($50, 5.5 hours)  <a href=\"https://www.ourbus.com/\">https://www.ourbus.com</a></li><li>Flight from Ithaca: You can find a direct flight from NYC to the Ithaca Tompkins airport <br/><br/></li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_VUUMin": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the refund policy?",
            "content": "<p><strong>Soul Awakening Program Refund Policy</strong></p><p>We understand that plans can change, and we want to ensure a fair and flexible refund policy for all participants of the <strong>Soul Awakening Program with Paramahamsa Vishwananda</strong>.</p><h3><strong>Refund Eligibility:<br/></strong></h3><p>Request a refund at least <strong>14 days before</strong> the program start date to receive a <strong>100% refund</strong> of your payment.<br/><br/>If you request a refund between <strong>7-13 days before</strong> the start date, you will receive a <strong>50% refund</strong>.<br/><br/>Refund requests made <strong>less than 7 days before</strong> the program start date are not eligible, as program resources and preparations will already be in place.<br/></p><h3><strong>How to Request a Refund:</strong></h3><p>To request a refund, please contact our support team at <strong>[support email]</strong> with your enrollment details. Refunds will be processed to the original payment method within <strong>7-10 business days</strong>.</p><h3><strong>Exceptions:</strong></h3><p>Refunds will not be issued for missed sessions, schedule conflicts, or personal circumstances. However, in cases of <strong>extraordinary situations</strong>, please reach out to discuss possible options.</p><p>We appreciate your understanding and look forward to supporting you on your spiritual journey with <strong>Bhakti Marga</strong>.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
